                <note rend="inline" type="source">No. 273.</note>
                <note rend="inline">NATURALIZATION LAW.</note>
                <head>Mr. Motley to Mr.
                        Fish.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 333.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Legation of the United
                                States,</hi><hi rendition="#italic"> London</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1870-05-14"><hi rendition="#italic">May</hi>
                            14, 1870</date>. (Received May 26.)</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> * * * I beg to refer you to * * * the
                    naturalization bill which has just received the royal assent, and a copy of
                    which accompanies this dispatch.</p>


